  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、急がないと無くなっちゃうよ～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But if we don't hurry, they'll run out!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "女の子",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫よ。神官長様が全員に配られるって\n仰ってたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry. The High Priest said there would be enough for everyone."
